:: RobinTemple Transformation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.transformation_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.transformation_day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.transformation_count to 0>>
<</if>>
<<set $RobinTemple.transformation_count += 1>>
<<switch $RobinTemple.transformation_kind>>
  <<case 'fox'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Robin rests <<his>> head on your tail. "I was only going to close my eyes for a moment," <<he>> says. An initiate clears <<his>> throat, and Robin sits up at once.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        罗宾把头枕在你的尾巴上。“我只是想闭一会儿眼，”<<he>>说。一名见习者清了清嗓子，罗宾立刻坐直。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'wolf'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You nudge Robin gently. <<He>> notices your ears and scratches behind one, then remembers where you are and pulls <<his>> hand back with a smile.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你轻轻碰了碰罗宾。<<He>>留意到你的耳朵，挠了挠耳根，随后想起自己身在何处，笑着收回手。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'cat'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You settle close to Robin. <<He>> strokes your hair as <<he>> finishes a line of prayer. A quiet purr makes <<him>> lose <<his>> place.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你挨着罗宾坐下。<<He>>一边念完那句祷词，一边轻抚你的头发。你轻轻呼噜一声，<<he>>便忘了念到哪里。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'bird'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Your song draws a few listeners. Robin waits until you finish before joining their applause. "You should sing here again," <<he>> says.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你的歌声引来几名听众。罗宾等你唱完，也跟着鼓掌。“下次还来唱吧，”<<he>>说。
    <</language>>
  <<case 'cow'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You touch Robin’s shoulder with your head. <<He>> reaches toward your horn, then pauses. "Does it hurt if I touch it?" <<he>> asks before moving closer.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你用头轻碰罗宾的肩。<<He>>伸手想摸你的角，又停住了。“碰它会疼吗？”<<he>>问过才靠近。
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<<npcincr Robin love 2>><<stress -2>><br><br><<glove>><<lstress>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
